格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness plugin for shareable session deep links","id":"gh:1334108131","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-session-deeplink","slug":"R3alloc/dsh-session-deeplink","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin for shareable session deep links"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-session-deeplink"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"中文 | English"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"这是一个 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端插件，用于通过 URL 直接访问和分享 DSH 会话。"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"### 功能"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- 通过 `/?session=<id>` 直接打开指定会话。\n- 切换当前会话时，自动同步浏览器地址栏中的会话 ID。\n- 从会话菜单在独立标签页中打开指定对话。\n- 从工作区菜单在独立标签页中创建"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"新对话。\n- 保留 URL 中其他查询参数和 fragment。\n- 完全运行在浏览器端，不添加任何 host 服务。"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### 从 npm 安装"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"将插件安装到 `web` profile："},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"重启 `dsh web`，然后打开任意会话。浏览器地址会变为："},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"只要该会话仍存在于 DSH 会话列表中，打开此 URL 就会恢复到同一会话。"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### 从 GitHub 安装"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Git 依赖会通过包内的 `prepare` 脚本在本机完成构建："},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"pnpm 10 及以上版本可能要求先在对应 profile 的 `pnpm-workspace.yaml` 中明确授权构建，然后重新执行安装命令："},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"日常安装建议使用 npm 包，因为 npm 包已经包含构建好的客户端 bundle，不需要在安装时执行构建代码。"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### 开发"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### 兼容性"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"当前版本适配 DeepSeek Harness `0.2.1-rc.2`，并保留对旧版 `list.current` 会话选择状态的兼容。DeepSeek Harness 目前仍处于开发者预览阶段，后"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"k Harness `0.2.1-rc.2`，并保留对旧版 `list.current` 会话选择状态的兼容。DeepSeek Harness 目前仍处于开发者预览阶段，后续版本可能需要同步更新插件。"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### 许可证"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"MIT"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## English"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"A web client plugin for DeepSeek Harness that makes sessions directly addressable and shareable by U"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"eb client plugin for DeepSeek Harness that makes sessions directly addressable and shareable by URL."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Features"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- Opens `/?session=<id>` directly in the requested session.\n- Keeps the address bar synchronized whe"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"n the active session changes.\n- Opens a selected conversation in its own tab from the session menu.\n"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"- Creates a new conversation in its own tab from the workspace menu.\n- Preserves unrelated query par"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"ameters and URL fragments.\n- Runs entirely in the browser and adds no host-side service."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### Install from npm"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Install the bundle into the `web` profile:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`, then open a session. The browser URL becomes:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Opening that URL restores the same session as long as it still exists in the DSH session list."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### Install from GitHub"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Git dependencies build locally through the package's `prepare` script:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"pnpm 10 and later may require explicitly allowing the package build in the profile's `pnpm-workspace"},{"id":"p39s2","text":".yaml` before retrying the command:"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Prefer the npm package for normal installation because it already contains the built client bundle a"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"nd does not execute build code during installation."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"### Development"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"### Compatibility"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"Compatible with DeepSeek Harness `0.2.1-rc.2`, while retaining a fallback for the legacy `list.curre"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"nt` session-selection state. DeepSeek Harness is currently a developer preview, so future releases m"},{"id":"p45s3","text":"ay require plugin updates."},{"id":"p46s1","text":"### License"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
